{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/extras/af84b9093923ffc2c23307618c131fea.poster.avif?t=1758122551\" width=600 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/extras/af84b9093923ffc2c23307618c131fea.webm?t=1758122551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You just dissociated from reality...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, the imaginary world you've landed in is as disturbed as your mental state. Gather your courage and confront your darkest thoughts in this <strong>8-bit psychological horror RPG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/extras/dad22375f6b59884053b1d08bf545d1c.poster.avif?t=1758122551\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/extras/dad22375f6b59884053b1d08bf545d1c.webm?t=1758122551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>True retro compatibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innerwhy was built to run on the <strong>Game Boy Color.</strong> Every technical limitation has been embraced: <strong>pixel art, chiptune soundtrack, limited storage\u2026</strong> it\u2019s all part of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/extras/cca403683d125ef48188e94044ca2e17.avif?t=1758122551\" width=616 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everyone is feeling bad...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this retro setting, you play as Manda, a young woman trapped in a crumbling imaginary world. <strong>Here, everyone is losing their mind:</strong> mushrooms fall into despair, pumpkins get angry, and goblins are fed up with life.\u00a0<i>(Goblins are not included in the demo, but are available in the full game.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/extras/de316bc308d1606f9220dabcee87546f.poster.avif?t=1758122551\" width=600 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/extras/de316bc308d1606f9220dabcee87546f.webm?t=1758122551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic turn-based battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save these troubled souls by battling them in <strong>turn-based combat</strong> powered by your <strong>emotions.</strong> Stay alert and dodge their negative vibes in real-time during <strong>Bullet Hell-style minigames.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/extras/d7e85d54757c552c314001bcd3515272.avif?t=1758122551\" width=616 height=496 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meta-progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will die. Probably more than once. But don\u2019t worry, a <strong>meta-progression</strong> system will make you stronger with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/extras/c2cccc5810bdc900111ff45030cccb24.poster.avif?t=1758122551\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/extras/c2cccc5810bdc900111ff45030cccb24.webm?t=1758122551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Randomly generated worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, randomly generated worlds ensure each playthrough offers a fresh adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this demo of INNERWHY,</strong> you can experience the complete first chapter <i>(around 45 minutes of gameplay).</i> You will have access to the combat mechanics, meta-progression, and the introduction to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo does not include</strong> chapters 2 to 6, which feature new enemies, unique battles, and the continuation of the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Add Innerwhy to your wishlist so you don\u2019t miss the release!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022020?t=1758122551","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022020?t=1758122551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/b9a438c7c86c4fb603188b0732e2199fc2ade9f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758122551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022020/b9a438c7c86c4fb603188b0732e2199fc2ade9f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758122551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game addresses sensitive themes,